Rule 2 (out tensor dtype follows input: preserve float/complex, promote non-float to float/complex)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (dtype_(v_1) ≥ 6 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10) then dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_1) else (dtype_(v_2) ≥ 6 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 10)
