Rule 3 (out tensor must have the same shape as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (input tensor must have a numeric dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
